{"id":"0e69f96cbdd26c82","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/668_谓词变换器演算.md","title":"668 谓词变换器演算","display":"668_谓词变换器演算","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}=\\{P_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}=\\{P_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>谓词构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{patom},\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{patom},\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>谓词变换器构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id},\\quad \\operatorname{fail},\\quad \\operatorname{magic},\\quad \\operatorname{assert},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{meet},\\quad \\operatorname{join}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{id},\\quad \\operatorname{fail},\\quad \\operatorname{magic},\\quad \\operatorname{assert},\\quad \\operatorname{seq},\\quad \\operatorname{meet},\\quad \\operatorname{join}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S;T\">\\(S;T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\sqcap T\">\\(S\\sqcap T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\sqcup T\">\\(S\\sqcup T\\)</span>，判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\sqsubseteq T\">\\(S\\sqsubseteq T\\)</span> 表示变换器精化序。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-谓词与变换器\">2. 谓词与变换器</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Assn}_{668},\\mathsf{Trans}_{668})\">\\((\\mathsf{Assn}_{668},\\mathsf{Trans}_{668})\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小二元集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}\">\\(P_i\\in\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{patom}(P_i)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\">\\(\\operatorname{patom}(P_i)\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg P\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\">\\(\\neg P\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\">\\(P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\to Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\">\\(P\\to Q\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id},\\operatorname{fail},\\operatorname{magic}\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(\\operatorname{id},\\operatorname{fail},\\operatorname{magic}\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{assert}(P)\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(\\operatorname{assert}(P)\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S;T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(S;T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\sqcap T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(S\\sqcap T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\sqcup T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(S\\sqcup T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义判断载体</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ref}_{668}=\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Trans}_{668},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ref}_{668}=\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Trans}_{668},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S,T)\">\\((S,T)\\)</span> 显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\sqsubseteq T\">\\(S\\sqsubseteq T\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由谓词名\">3. 自由谓词名</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{668}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FT}_{668}:\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{668}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FT}_{668}:\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(\\operatorname{patom}(P))=\\{P\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(\\operatorname{patom}(P))=\\{P\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(\\neg P)=\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(P),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(P\\to Q)=\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(Q),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(\\neg P)=\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(P),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(P\\to Q)=\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(P)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(Q),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(\\operatorname{id})=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(\\operatorname{fail})=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(\\operatorname{magic})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(\\operatorname{id})=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(\\operatorname{fail})=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(\\operatorname{magic})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(\\operatorname{assert}(P))=\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(\\operatorname{assert}(P))=\\operatorname{FV}_{668}(P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S;T)=\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S)\\cup\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S;T)=\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S)\\cup\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S\\sqcap T)=\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S)\\cup\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(T),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S\\sqcup T)=\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S)\\cup\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S\\sqcap T)=\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S)\\cup\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(T),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S\\sqcup T)=\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(S)\\cup\\operatorname{FT}_{668}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{668}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BT}_{668}:\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{668}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BT}_{668}:\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为常空函数。没有绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,668}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,668}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span> 上的构造树相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-谓词名替换\">4. 谓词名替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ASub}_{668}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{668},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ASub}_{668}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{Assn}_{668},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSub}_{668}:\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TSub}_{668}:\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}\\times\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{patom}(R)[P:=A]=\n\\begin{cases}\nA,&amp;R=P,\\\\\n\\operatorname{patom}(R),&amp;R\\ne P,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n\\bot[P:=A]=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{patom}(R)[P:=A]=\n\\begin{cases}\nA,&amp;R=P,\\\\\n\\operatorname{patom}(R),&amp;R\\ne P,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n\\bot[P:=A]=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg B)[P:=A]=\\neg(B[P:=A]),\\quad\n(B\\to C)[P:=A]=B[P:=A]\\to C[P:=A],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg B)[P:=A]=\\neg(B[P:=A]),\\quad\n(B\\to C)[P:=A]=B[P:=A]\\to C[P:=A],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}[P:=A]=\\operatorname{id},\\quad\n\\operatorname{fail}[P:=A]=\\operatorname{fail},\\quad\n\\operatorname{magic}[P:=A]=\\operatorname{magic},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{id}[P:=A]=\\operatorname{id},\\quad\n\\operatorname{fail}[P:=A]=\\operatorname{fail},\\quad\n\\operatorname{magic}[P:=A]=\\operatorname{magic},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{assert}(B)[P:=A]=\\operatorname{assert}(B[P:=A]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{assert}(B)[P:=A]=\\operatorname{assert}(B[P:=A]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(S;T)[P:=A]=S[P:=A];T[P:=A],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(S;T)[P:=A]=S[P:=A];T[P:=A],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(S\\sqcap T)[P:=A]=S[P:=A]\\sqcap T[P:=A],\\quad\n(S\\sqcup T)[P:=A]=S[P:=A]\\sqcup T[P:=A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(S\\sqcap T)[P:=A]=S[P:=A]\\sqcap T[P:=A],\\quad\n(S\\sqcup T)[P:=A]=S[P:=A]\\sqcup T[P:=A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>精化公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Refl}^{668}=\\{S\\sqsubseteq S:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Refl}^{668}=\\{S\\sqsubseteq S:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SeqId}^{668}=\\{\\operatorname{id};S\\sqsubseteq S:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}\\cup\\{S;\\operatorname{id}\\sqsubseteq S:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SeqId}^{668}=\\{\\operatorname{id};S\\sqsubseteq S:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}\\cup\\{S;\\operatorname{id}\\sqsubseteq S:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Meet}^{668}=\\{S\\sqcap T\\sqsubseteq S:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}\\cup\\{S\\sqcap T\\sqsubseteq T:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Meet}^{668}=\\{S\\sqcap T\\sqsubseteq S:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}\\cup\\{S\\sqcap T\\sqsubseteq T:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Join}^{668}=\\{S\\sqsubseteq S\\sqcup T:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}\\cup\\{T\\sqsubseteq S\\sqcup T:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Join}^{668}=\\{S\\sqsubseteq S\\sqcup T:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}\\cup\\{T\\sqsubseteq S\\sqcup T:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{FailMagic}^{668}=\\{\\operatorname{fail}\\sqsubseteq S:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}\\cup\\{S\\sqsubseteq\\operatorname{magic}:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{FailMagic}^{668}=\\{\\operatorname{fail}\\sqsubseteq S:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}\\cup\\{S\\sqsubseteq\\operatorname{magic}:S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{668}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Refl}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SeqId}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Meet}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Join}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{FailMagic}^{668}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{668}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{Refl}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SeqId}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Meet}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Join}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{FailMagic}^{668}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>传递规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{S\\sqsubseteq T\\qquad T\\sqsubseteq U}{S\\sqsubseteq U}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{S\\sqsubseteq T\\qquad T\\sqsubseteq U}{S\\sqsubseteq U}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{668}=\\{((S\\sqsubseteq T,T\\sqsubseteq U),S\\sqsubseteq U):S,T,U\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{668}=\\{((S\\sqsubseteq T,T\\sqsubseteq U),S\\sqsubseteq U):S,T,U\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>顺序单调规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{S_0\\sqsubseteq S_1\\qquad T_0\\sqsubseteq T_1}{S_0;T_0\\sqsubseteq S_1;T_1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{S_0\\sqsubseteq S_1\\qquad T_0\\sqsubseteq T_1}{S_0;T_0\\sqsubseteq S_1;T_1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{SeqMono}^{668}=\\{((S_0\\sqsubseteq S_1,T_0\\sqsubseteq T_1),S_0;T_0\\sqsubseteq S_1;T_1):S_0,S_1,T_0,T_1\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{SeqMono}^{668}=\\{((S_0\\sqsubseteq S_1,T_0\\sqsubseteq T_1),S_0;T_0\\sqsubseteq S_1;T_1):S_0,S_1,T_0,T_1\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>交引入规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{U\\sqsubseteq S\\qquad U\\sqsubseteq T}{U\\sqsubseteq S\\sqcap T}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{U\\sqsubseteq S\\qquad U\\sqsubseteq T}{U\\sqsubseteq S\\sqcap T}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetIntro}^{668}=\\{((U\\sqsubseteq S,U\\sqsubseteq T),U\\sqsubseteq S\\sqcap T):S,T,U\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetIntro}^{668}=\\{((U\\sqsubseteq S,U\\sqsubseteq T),U\\sqsubseteq S\\sqcap T):S,T,U\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并消去规则显示为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{S\\sqsubseteq U\\qquad T\\sqsubseteq U}{S\\sqcup T\\sqsubseteq U}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{S\\sqsubseteq U\\qquad T\\sqsubseteq U}{S\\sqcup T\\sqsubseteq U}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{JoinElim}^{668}=\\{((S\\sqsubseteq U,T\\sqsubseteq U),S\\sqcup T\\sqsubseteq U):S,T,U\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{JoinElim}^{668}=\\{((S\\sqsubseteq U,T\\sqsubseteq U),S\\sqcup T\\sqsubseteq U):S,T,U\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{668}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{SeqMono}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetIntro}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{JoinElim}^{668}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{668}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{SeqMono}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetIntro}^{668}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{JoinElim}^{668}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ref}_{668}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ref}_{668}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in\\mathsf{Ref}_{668}\">\\(J\\in\\mathsf{Ref}_{668}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{668}(\\Gamma,J)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{668}(\\Gamma,J)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(J_0,\\ldots,J_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(J_0,\\ldots,J_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad m&gt;0,\\quad J_i\\in\\mathsf{Ref}_{668}\\ \\text{对所有 }i&lt;m,\\quad J_{m-1}=J.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad m&gt;0,\\quad J_i\\in\\mathsf{Ref}_{668}\\ \\text{对所有 }i&lt;m,\\quad J_{m-1}=J.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个合法行索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列 6 项中的一项（各项之间为析取，各项内部条件为合取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(J_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{668}\">\\(J_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((J_j,J_k),J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{668}\">\\(((J_j,J_k),J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}^{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((J_j,J_k),J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{SeqMono}^{668}\">\\(((J_j,J_k),J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{SeqMono}^{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((J_j,J_k),J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetIntro}^{668}\">\\(((J_j,J_k),J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MeetIntro}^{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((J_j,J_k),J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{JoinElim}^{668}\">\\(((J_j,J_k),J_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{JoinElim}^{668}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{668}S\\sqsubseteq T\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{668}S\\sqsubseteq T\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{668}(\\Gamma,S\\sqsubseteq T)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{668}(\\Gamma,S\\sqsubseteq T)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{668}=\\{S\\sqsubseteq T:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668},\\ \\varnothing\\vdash_{668}S\\sqsubseteq T\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{668}=\\{S\\sqsubseteq T:S,T\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668},\\ \\varnothing\\vdash_{668}S\\sqsubseteq T\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>谓词变换器演算的目标差异是主对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span>，主判断为变换器精化序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\sqsubseteq T\">\\(S\\sqsubseteq T\\)</span>，而不是程序三元组。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-状态谓词格与变换器语义\">10. 状态谓词格与变换器语义</h1>\n<p>定义状态集合为一个本地参数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{St}_{668}\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{St}_{668}\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>状态谓词格为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{St}_{668}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{St}_{668}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其序、交、并和端点定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\le_{668}Y\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq Y,\\qquad\nX\\wedge_{668}Y=X\\cap Y,\\qquad\nX\\vee_{668}Y=X\\cup Y,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\le_{668}Y\\Longleftrightarrow X\\subseteq Y,\\qquad\nX\\wedge_{668}Y=X\\cap Y,\\qquad\nX\\vee_{668}Y=X\\cup Y,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{668}^{\\mathrm{sem}}=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\top_{668}^{\\mathrm{sem}}=\\mathsf{St}_{668}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot_{668}^{\\mathrm{sem}}=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\top_{668}^{\\mathrm{sem}}=\\mathsf{St}_{668}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>谓词名赋值为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta:\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta:\\mathsf{Pred}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>断言解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧^A_{668,\\eta}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧^A_{668,\\eta}:\\mathsf{Assn}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{patom}(P)⟧^A_{668,\\eta}=\\eta(P),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧^A_{668,\\eta}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{patom}(P)⟧^A_{668,\\eta}=\\eta(P),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧^A_{668,\\eta}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg P⟧^A_{668,\\eta}=\\mathsf{St}_{668}\\setminus⟦ P⟧^A_{668,\\eta},\n\\quad\n⟦ P\\to Q⟧^A_{668,\\eta}=(\\mathsf{St}_{668}\\setminus⟦ P⟧^A_{668,\\eta})\\cup⟦ Q⟧^A_{668,\\eta}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg P⟧^A_{668,\\eta}=\\mathsf{St}_{668}\\setminus⟦ P⟧^A_{668,\\eta},\n\\quad\n⟦ P\\to Q⟧^A_{668,\\eta}=(\\mathsf{St}_{668}\\setminus⟦ P⟧^A_{668,\\eta})\\cup⟦ Q⟧^A_{668,\\eta}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义谓词变换器集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MTrans}_{668}\n=\n\\{\\Phi:\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}:\n\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to\\Phi(X)\\subseteq\\Phi(Y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MTrans}_{668}\n=\n\\{\\Phi:\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}:\n\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to\\Phi(X)\\subseteq\\Phi(Y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变换器解释</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧^T_{668,\\eta}:\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{MTrans}_{668}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧^T_{668,\\eta}:\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\to\\mathsf{MTrans}_{668}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{id}⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=X,\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{fail}⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{magic}⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\\mathsf{St}_{668},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{id}⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=X,\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{fail}⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n⟦\\operatorname{magic}⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\\mathsf{St}_{668},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{assert}(P)⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\n⟦ P⟧^A_{668,\\eta}\\cap X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{assert}(P)⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\n⟦ P⟧^A_{668,\\eta}\\cap X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ S;T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ S;T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ S\\sqcap T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\cap⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ S\\sqcap T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\cap⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ S\\sqcup T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\cup⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ S\\sqcup T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)=\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\cup⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义精化序定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668}T\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\eta\\ \\forall X\\in\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\,\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\subseteq\n⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668}T\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\eta\\ \\forall X\\in\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\,\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\subseteq\n⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{668}S\\sqsubseteq T\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall U\\sqsubseteq V\\in\\Gamma\\ U\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668}V\\bigr)\n\\to\nS\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668}T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{668}S\\sqsubseteq T\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall U\\sqsubseteq V\\in\\Gamma\\ U\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668}V\\bigr)\n\\to\nS\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668}T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PT}_{668}=(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668},\\mathsf{Assn}_{668},\\mathsf{Trans}_{668},\\mathsf{Ref}_{668},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{668},\\operatorname{FT}_{668},\\operatorname{BV}_{668},\\operatorname{BT}_{668},\n\\operatorname{ASub}_{668},\\operatorname{TSub}_{668},\\equiv_{\\alpha,668},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{668},\\mathsf{Rule}_{668},\\vdash_{668},\\mathsf{Thm}_{668},\n\\mathsf{St}_{668},\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668},\\mathsf{MTrans}_{668},\n⟦-⟧^A_{668},⟦-⟧^T_{668},\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668},\\models_{668}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PT}_{668}=(\\mathsf{Pred}_{668},\\mathsf{Assn}_{668},\\mathsf{Trans}_{668},\\mathsf{Ref}_{668},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{668},\\operatorname{FT}_{668},\\operatorname{BV}_{668},\\operatorname{BT}_{668},\n\\operatorname{ASub}_{668},\\operatorname{TSub}_{668},\\equiv_{\\alpha,668},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{668},\\mathsf{Rule}_{668},\\vdash_{668},\\mathsf{Thm}_{668},\n\\mathsf{St}_{668},\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668},\\mathsf{MTrans}_{668},\n⟦-⟧^A_{668},⟦-⟧^T_{668},\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668},\\models_{668}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含谓词变换器句法、状态谓词格、单调变换器语义、精化证明关系和语义后承；不含具体程序命令语义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-008-变换器-law-表\">12. 008 变换器 law 表</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\">\\(S\\in\\mathsf{Trans}_{668}\\)</span>，单调性 law 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MonoLaw}_{668}(S)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\eta\\ \\forall X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\,\n(X\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\subseteq⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(Y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MonoLaw}_{668}(S)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\eta\\ \\forall X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PredSem}_{668}\\,\n(X\\subseteq Y\\Rightarrow⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\subseteq⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(Y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义精化的逐点见证关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RefPoint}_{668}(S,T,\\eta,X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\subseteq⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RefPoint}_{668}(S,T,\\eta,X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n⟦ S⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X)\\subseteq⟦ T⟧^T_{668,\\eta}(X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668}T\">\\(S\\sqsubseteq^{\\mathrm{sem}}_{668}T\\)</span> 当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,X\">\\(\\eta,X\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RefPoint}_{668}(S,T,\\eta,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{RefPoint}_{668}(S,T,\\eta,X)\\)</span>。闭合系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PT}^{008}_{668}\n=(\\mathcal{PT}_{668},\\mathsf{Prf}_{668},\\operatorname{MonoLaw}_{668},\\operatorname{RefPoint}_{668}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PT}^{008}_{668}\n=(\\mathcal{PT}_{668},\\mathsf{Prf}_{668},\\operatorname{MonoLaw}_{668},\\operatorname{RefPoint}_{668}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-谓词与变换器","text":"2. 谓词与变换器","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由谓词名","text":"3. 自由谓词名","level":1},{"id":"4.-谓词名替换","text":"4. 谓词名替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-状态谓词格与变换器语义","text":"10. 状态谓词格与变换器语义","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1},{"id":"12.-008-变换器-law-表","text":"12. 008 变换器 law 表","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\